WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Small actions. Real change. A better neighbourhood starts with one report. Here is how it works.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:13.000
See your city in full view. Open the city map. Explore nearby reports and the issues that need attention first.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Spot it. Share it. Choose Report an issue. Describe the problem and add a photo so the team can understand it.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Put the problem on the map. Choose a neighbourhood, then tap the map or move the pin to mark the right location.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:37.000
One problem. One stronger case. Review the category and nearby matches. Add your voice to an existing case, or register a new one.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:45.000
The right team. A clear next step. In the authority workspace, teams assign departments, update status, and share progress notes.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Every step, in the open. Enter your case number in Track a report. See updates and confirm the completed fix with a photo.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Your city. Your move. Explore the map. Send your first signal. Be part of the difference.
